{"title":"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A white cylindrical silo has a diameter of 30 feet and a height of 80 feet. A red stripe with a horizontal width of 3 feet is painted on the silo, as shown, making two complete revolutions around it. What is the area of the stripe in square feet?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/0/db0ee67d222e80fda19ce7927dc5efb178a81aff.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]  size(250);defaultpen(linewidth(0.8)); draw(ellipse(origin, 3, 1)); fill((3,0)--(3,2)--(-3,2)--(-3,0)--cycle, white); draw((3,0)--(3,16)^^(-3,0)--(-3,16)); draw((0, 15)--(3, 12)^^(0, 16)--(3, 13)); filldraw(ellipse((0, 16), 3, 1), white, black); draw((-3,11)--(3, 5)^^(-3,10)--(3, 4)); draw((-3,2)--(0,-1)^^(-3,1)--(-1,-0.89)); draw((0,-1)--(0,15), dashed); draw((3,-2)--(3,-4)^^(-3,-2)--(-3,-4)); draw((-7,0)--(-5,0)^^(-7,16)--(-5,16)); draw((3,-3)--(-3,-3), Arrows(6)); draw((-6,0)--(-6,16), Arrows(6)); draw((-2,9)--(-1,9), Arrows(3)); label(&quot;$3$&quot;, (-1.375,9.05), dir(260), fontsize(7)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;, (0,15), N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, (0,-1), NE); label(&quot;$30$&quot;, (0, -3), S); label(&quot;$80$&quot;, (-6, 8), W);[/asy]\" width=\"208\" height=\"418\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/a/b0ab0278bbd4774e446116373c531de5a794cca1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 120 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 180 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 240 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 360 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 480$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"432\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The cylinder can be \"unwrapped\" into a rectangle, and we see that there are two stripes, each of which is a parallelogram with base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and height <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, the area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/8/1788e2f74430a7b78a0232a7ab20f3ee59188093.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\times40\\times2=240\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 240}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"234\" height=\"32\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/PYTi6qZUAPw\">https://youtu.be/PYTi6qZUAPw</a>\n</p><p>Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A\">2004 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_